Interface Description

Customers who have signed a contract with the platform can create/modify orders through this interface. The current order creation interface supports order modification, that is, if the customer order number (txlogisticId) already exists and the corresponding order has not been collected, directly modify the existing order. If the recipient address changes, get the latest three-segment code/big end return;

